WEBVTT

00:21.730 --> 00:23.271
Poor thing!

00:23.271 --> 00:25.230
It must have been washed away
from somewhere.

00:26.021 --> 00:28.481
It would end up being
somebody's meal at this rate.

00:48.854 --> 00:51.229
You'll be popping out of there
before you know it.

01:52.730 --> 01:57.314
Lord of the Egg Mountain,
please protect these children.

01:58.064 --> 02:00.105
Let them hatch safe and sound.

02:11.855 --> 02:13.272
It's a pleasure to meet you.

02:13.272 --> 02:15.064
I'm your mother!

02:18.645 --> 02:19.522
Huh?

02:35.645 --> 02:37.272
That's a strange child.

02:37.272 --> 02:38.481
What color is that?!

02:38.481 --> 02:40.105
And those sharp teeth!

02:40.105 --> 02:41.522
Is he safe?

02:41.522 --> 02:44.730
We don't want a meat-eater child
around here!

02:44.730 --> 02:47.522
But look at how happy he is
eating berries...

02:47.522 --> 02:49.105
Perhaps now, but...

02:55.645 --> 02:59.605
Is this the child that was born
from the egg that was found?

03:00.147 --> 03:01.397
Y-Yes...

03:05.397 --> 03:08.272
Stop it! What are you doing?!

03:08.272 --> 03:10.064
He could be a meat-eater.

03:10.064 --> 03:12.230
Better to kill him now, to be safe!

03:12.230 --> 03:14.563
Kill him?!

03:15.605 --> 03:17.813
If you don't want that,
then get rid of him!

03:18.147 --> 03:22.397
We have our own children to take care of.

03:22.730 --> 03:25.397
But... he's too small to...

03:29.730 --> 03:34.813
He's small now, but if he's a meat-eater,
he'll eat us all up sooner or later!

03:34.813 --> 03:37.230
Including you and your son!

03:49.230 --> 03:52.772
There's a lot of food for you here.

03:54.481 --> 03:58.272
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

04:43.772 --> 04:46.314
They're all migrating north, huh?

04:46.314 --> 04:49.022
Yeah. Let's go, Heart!

04:49.563 --> 04:50.646
Wait for me!

04:54.730 --> 04:57.105
Wait, Light!

05:08.813 --> 05:10.189
Come here, Heart!

05:10.189 --> 05:11.813
Again?!

05:11.813 --> 05:13.772
But I've never won at this...

05:13.772 --> 05:15.730
1-2-3!

05:17.646 --> 05:20.397
You're as weak as always, Heart!

05:20.397 --> 05:23.355
You're too picky about what you eat,
and that's why you don't get stronger.

05:23.355 --> 05:25.189
Just eating soft berries...

05:26.105 --> 05:28.230
But when I try to eat leaves...

05:28.646 --> 05:30.563
...it makes me gag.

05:34.272 --> 05:37.397
Yuck!
You're eating that kind of thing again?!

05:37.397 --> 05:38.730
I don't eat it.

05:38.730 --> 05:41.105
Just sucking on it feels good.

05:41.105 --> 05:44.688
Ick! Yuck! Heart, you're a weirdo!

05:45.397 --> 05:48.314
I'm gonna suck on your tail next, Light!

05:50.230 --> 05:52.646
Light! Heart!

05:52.980 --> 05:54.772
Oh, Mom!

05:57.563 --> 06:00.897
Mom, everyone went north.

06:01.230 --> 06:04.230
Why didn't we go with them?

06:04.230 --> 06:06.481
I don't care for the cold up there.

06:07.105 --> 06:11.855
Besides,
I'm just happy being with you two.

06:20.064 --> 06:21.772
Looks like it's going to be
another fine day tomorrow.

06:25.355 --> 06:29.105
We've got to look for more berries
that Heart can eat.

06:29.105 --> 06:31.813
Why don't we make
an outing of it tomorrow?

06:31.813 --> 06:37.147
Heart should get used to eating acorns
and leaves and everything else.

06:37.147 --> 06:39.105
Let's not talk like that.

06:39.605 --> 06:42.022
I can eat anything!

06:58.147 --> 07:01.439
All right,
both of you look for a nice treat to eat.

07:01.439 --> 07:04.688
Use both your eyes and nose
to find out what's where.

07:05.064 --> 07:06.147
Okay!

07:07.730 --> 07:10.022
Don't eat everything off of one tree!

07:18.272 --> 07:19.813
Red berries!

07:19.813 --> 07:21.605
Yayyy!

07:24.646 --> 07:27.813
Mmm, these are the best, aren't they?

07:27.813 --> 07:28.605
Uh-huh!

07:35.230 --> 07:37.563
You're chasing small animals again?!

07:41.730 --> 07:42.813
I'm stuck!

07:42.813 --> 07:44.105
M-Me too!

08:09.481 --> 08:10.314
Let go!

08:10.314 --> 08:11.730
Let go of me!

08:15.855 --> 08:21.605
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry...

08:21.605 --> 08:28.189
With his coarse body and sharp fangs...

08:28.189 --> 08:33.605
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry...

08:33.605 --> 08:39.563
He says, "Where are the crying children?
I'm coming to get you!"

08:40.772 --> 08:44.355
"With my coarse body...

08:45.105 --> 08:46.938
And my sharp fangs..."

08:46.938 --> 08:49.230
"-Coarse body...
And my sharp fangs..."

08:49.230 --> 08:51.397
Sharp fangs...?!

08:51.397 --> 08:57.397
He says, "Where are the crying children?
I'm coming to get you!"

08:57.397 --> 08:58.938
Light...

09:02.688 --> 09:04.064
Boys...

09:06.355 --> 09:08.563
Would you mind not raising your voices?

09:08.855 --> 09:11.355
My baby just fell asleep.

09:12.022 --> 09:14.980
D-Did you sing that?

09:15.439 --> 09:17.439
Are you... a Big Jaw?

09:17.439 --> 09:19.688
Am I a Big Jaw?

09:19.688 --> 09:21.397
You must be kidding me!

09:21.397 --> 09:28.439
Big Jaws are giant, fearsome meat-eaters
who would gobble all of us up!

09:28.855 --> 09:30.688
They would eat us?

09:30.688 --> 09:32.105
That's right...

09:32.105 --> 09:35.439
And they will
if you don't listen to your mother, boys!

10:00.855 --> 10:02.314
What was that about?

10:02.314 --> 10:04.772
She ran away after looking at you, Heart.

10:05.481 --> 10:06.355
Why?

10:06.355 --> 10:07.813
Why...?

10:08.105 --> 10:11.064
Come to think of it,
you look a little like the Big Jaws, Heart.

10:12.439 --> 10:15.522
You have a coarse body and sharp teeth...

10:16.147 --> 10:18.522
Look, you're different from me, see?

10:19.688 --> 10:21.897
I'm different from you, Light?

10:21.897 --> 10:23.064
Well, sure.

10:28.730 --> 10:30.064
Liar!

10:30.064 --> 10:31.980
H-Hey, Heart!

10:37.646 --> 10:39.813
Is that Heart's voice?

10:39.813 --> 10:41.855
Heart! Light!

10:42.813 --> 10:45.730
Mom!

10:46.980 --> 10:48.522
How dare you say that to him?!

10:49.563 --> 10:52.064
Heart is your little brother, isn't he?

10:52.064 --> 10:54.439
I won't have you
saying things like that to him.

10:54.772 --> 10:56.688
I'm sorry!

10:58.772 --> 11:01.646
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

11:01.646 --> 11:03.938
Don't cry, Heart!

11:03.938 --> 11:05.772
Don't cry!

11:23.022 --> 11:24.605
It's glistening.

11:25.439 --> 11:29.230
It would be nice if we could live
in this beautiful valley forever.

11:30.064 --> 11:31.064
Yeah...

11:36.105 --> 11:39.314
But there aren't that many
red berries left here, are there?

11:41.147 --> 11:46.938
I wonder why I can't eat leaves
and acorns like everybody else.

11:49.105 --> 11:51.147
Everyone has a weakness.

11:51.813 --> 11:54.481
Don't let what Light said get to you.

11:55.980 --> 11:58.189
He didn't really mean
anything bad by it, but...

11:58.522 --> 12:01.563
Mom, don't scold Light.

12:02.813 --> 12:06.230
Light's always searching
for soft fruits for me.

12:07.314 --> 12:11.688
I see.
He has his kind side too, doesn't he?

12:11.688 --> 12:12.314
Yeah.

12:16.730 --> 12:20.314
And you're very kind.

12:22.688 --> 12:25.772
I'm proud of both of you boys.

12:49.064 --> 12:51.230
My body itches...

13:04.938 --> 13:06.605
The least I can do...

13:07.397 --> 13:08.730
...is find my own food!

13:48.189 --> 13:49.397
What is this?

13:53.522 --> 13:55.980
My heart's beating fast!

14:21.772 --> 14:24.314
Light, go call your brother.

14:24.897 --> 14:26.355
We've gathered enough for today.

14:26.646 --> 14:28.189
Let's go home.

14:29.563 --> 14:33.481
Okay. He said he was going by the river,
so I'll bring him back.

14:33.813 --> 14:36.189
Don't worry, Mom. Wait right here.

14:47.105 --> 14:48.064
Out of the way, shrimp!

14:48.064 --> 14:49.064
You're in the way!

15:07.897 --> 15:09.522
You're dead...

15:32.355 --> 15:34.980
O-One-Eyed Baku!

15:34.980 --> 15:37.730
The Three-Horns are tough customers.

15:38.563 --> 15:40.938
Too bad about him.

15:41.688 --> 15:43.938
I'm sorry to put you to the trouble, Baku.

15:44.522 --> 15:47.147
This is your prey.

15:47.147 --> 15:48.855
Don't stand on ceremony.

15:49.189 --> 15:51.355
I appreciate it.

16:03.730 --> 16:07.314
Th-They're eating him...
They're eating him!

16:09.230 --> 16:10.272
I have to get out of here!

16:19.105 --> 16:21.314
I haven't seen you around before.

16:21.314 --> 16:22.688
Where you from?

16:26.605 --> 16:27.688
What's with this kid?

16:28.522 --> 16:29.813
What's wrong, Gonza?

16:29.813 --> 16:31.355
This kid is weird.

16:31.355 --> 16:33.563
He reeks like a plant-eater.

16:33.563 --> 16:34.688
Let me see...

16:35.813 --> 16:38.105
Hey, he smells yummy.

16:38.105 --> 16:38.813
Right?

16:50.813 --> 16:51.980
What's wrong?

16:52.355 --> 16:54.064
Are you hungry?

16:55.855 --> 16:58.938
Are you alone?

16:59.272 --> 17:00.938
Got no parents?

17:01.813 --> 17:04.314
I-I have a mom...

17:04.314 --> 17:05.397
Light, too...

17:08.439 --> 17:10.688
Then go home to her.

17:11.230 --> 17:13.980
This isn't your territory.

17:15.272 --> 17:17.397
You guys, too, leave him alone.

17:28.938 --> 17:30.064
Hey.

17:34.230 --> 17:35.855
What's your name?

17:38.397 --> 17:39.646
Heart!

17:39.646 --> 17:41.064
My name is Heart!

17:46.522 --> 17:49.355
All right, Heart. Be careful going home.

17:50.105 --> 17:53.272
There are some around her
who'll be drawn to the smell of blood.

17:53.855 --> 17:55.897
The smell of blood?

18:04.938 --> 18:06.938
Coarse body!

18:07.563 --> 18:09.813
Sharp fangs!

18:11.064 --> 18:13.355
They're gonna eat us!

18:15.522 --> 18:16.897
Those were...

18:16.897 --> 18:19.272
...Big Jaws!

18:22.563 --> 18:24.522
They're gonna eat me!
They're gonna eat me!

18:25.022 --> 18:26.522
They devoured that one!

18:26.522 --> 18:29.105
They were eating him!
They were eating him!

18:29.105 --> 18:31.688
They were eating him!
They were eating him!

18:43.938 --> 18:45.105
Heart!

18:49.855 --> 18:51.481
Heart, what happened?!

18:53.772 --> 18:54.938
Are you all right?!

18:54.938 --> 18:56.022
Are you hurt?!

18:56.772 --> 18:58.272
You're shivering!

18:58.272 --> 19:02.355
Mom! Mom!

19:02.355 --> 19:05.938
It's okay, Heart. I'm here.

19:05.938 --> 19:07.105
Let's go back together.

19:07.813 --> 19:11.272
Huh! What have we here?

19:11.272 --> 19:14.730
I was wondering why you ran into
this soggy-looking, little forest...

19:14.730 --> 19:17.522
But it was to meet a plant-eater?!

19:20.855 --> 19:23.855
What's the connection between you two?

19:24.522 --> 19:25.397
Heart!

19:29.147 --> 19:30.688
Run away, Heart!

19:31.813 --> 19:34.272
You're an odd couple.

19:34.272 --> 19:36.855
A plant-eater's worried
about a meat-eater?!

19:37.189 --> 19:39.314
Heart's my little brother!

19:39.314 --> 19:41.855
I'm not gonna let you lay a claw on him!

19:41.855 --> 19:44.605
How could he be your little brother?

19:44.897 --> 19:46.605
Take a good look at me.

19:47.105 --> 19:48.272
Look at me!

19:50.022 --> 19:52.730
That's right. Get a good look.

19:52.730 --> 19:57.189
I look like your weird-named friend,
"Heart" or whatever.

20:01.022 --> 20:05.813
That one's just like me, a meat-eater,
the king of the plains...

20:05.813 --> 20:07.481
A Big Jaw!

20:13.064 --> 20:15.397
It's a lie... It's a lie.

20:15.772 --> 20:17.272
It's no lie.

20:17.272 --> 20:20.772
You're lucky, getting to learn
one more thing in your last moments.

20:21.189 --> 20:22.730
And I think it's about time...

20:22.730 --> 20:24.522
It's a lie!

20:24.522 --> 20:25.938
No, it's not!

20:25.938 --> 20:29.481
Liar, liar! I'm a plant-eater!

20:29.481 --> 20:31.980
I'm my mother's son!

20:31.980 --> 20:35.147
H-Hey. You're a clueless brat, aren't you?

20:35.147 --> 20:36.105
Liar, liar!

20:36.105 --> 20:38.855
What do you think
you have those choppers for?

20:38.855 --> 20:41.439
Try sinking your teeth into his neck.

20:41.439 --> 20:43.439
Then you'll understand.

20:43.439 --> 20:48.439
You're a Big Jaw
and he's an irresistible treat.

20:48.439 --> 20:52.272
You lie! You lie! You lie! You lie!

20:52.272 --> 20:53.314
Liar!!

20:53.314 --> 20:56.105
Eeeyowww!

20:56.105 --> 20:58.230
Let go of me, you little...!

21:01.439 --> 21:03.730
Owowowowowww!

21:05.522 --> 21:07.481
All right, I got it! So stop!

21:10.605 --> 21:13.855
Let go of meeee!

21:14.980 --> 21:15.980
Heart!

21:17.522 --> 21:21.563
Why? We're the same...

21:22.605 --> 21:24.772
Owowowowowwww!

21:25.522 --> 21:27.730
Heart! H...?

21:36.897 --> 21:38.064
Heart?

21:46.272 --> 21:47.855
What should I do?

21:47.855 --> 21:49.897
Meat is delicious!

21:55.522 --> 21:57.855
Heart! Heart!

21:57.855 --> 21:59.314
Where are you going?!

21:59.314 --> 22:01.646
We have to get back! Mom is...

22:04.855 --> 22:08.563
Heart will be pleased
with all these berries I've gathered.

22:14.105 --> 22:16.189
I hope they get back soon...

22:38.105 --> 22:44.605
Sleepy baby, sleepy baby,
sleepy, go to sleep

22:45.688 --> 22:52.646
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry...

22:53.646 --> 22:55.605
-With his coarse body and sharp fangs...

22:55.605 --> 22:57.105
- Stay on guard!
- With his coarse body and sharp fangs...

22:57.105 --> 22:58.355
- He's nearby!
- With his coarse body and sharp fangs...

22:58.355 --> 22:59.647
- Yes, Captain!
- With his coarse body and sharp fangs...

22:59.647 --> 23:01.295
-With his coarse body and sharp fangs...

23:24.938 --> 23:27.105
Don't flinch, trample him!

23:27.105 --> 23:28.605
Yes, Captain!

23:35.522 --> 23:40.147
Captain,
I'm dizzy from standing up so much!

23:40.147 --> 23:43.481
Hang in there! Protect the children!

23:53.563 --> 23:57.147
Captain, I can't go on anymore!

23:59.688 --> 24:01.397
I'm done for, too!

24:01.397 --> 24:02.605
Me too...

24:09.147 --> 24:12.189
You bunch of gutless worms!

24:12.189 --> 24:16.064
Still, as long as I'm here,
you're not robbing this herd!

24:51.855 --> 24:52.646
Uh-oh!

24:56.855 --> 25:01.272
Heart!
You horned in on my territory again!

25:01.272 --> 25:02.813
What are you tryin' to do?!

25:02.813 --> 25:04.522
Sorry, my bad!

25:04.522 --> 25:07.189
But you can have my leftovers,
so don't hold a grudge!

25:07.189 --> 25:10.147
Okay, stubby Gonza?!

25:13.230 --> 25:14.481
Why, youuu...!

25:14.481 --> 25:17.605
You're dead! Heart!

25:30.980 --> 25:34.938
In my childhood,
I was raised as a plant-eater.

25:39.439 --> 25:42.230
I don't know why my mother did that,

25:42.980 --> 25:45.563
but in order to become
a full-fledged Big Jaw,

25:45.563 --> 25:48.272
I have to train my body
more than anyone else.

25:57.189 --> 26:00.605
My arms are especially weak...

26:10.730 --> 26:12.522
I have to get stronger...

26:17.772 --> 26:19.189
Well, well...

26:19.646 --> 26:23.980
We finally come back
to the base of Egg Mountain,

26:23.980 --> 26:27.397
and right away, a nuisance shows up,
saying he wants to return to the herd.

26:27.397 --> 26:32.189
No, it's my mother... I, uh...

26:34.189 --> 26:37.897
Fine. You look to be sturdy enough, boy,

26:37.897 --> 26:41.355
so as long as you're willing to serve the herd,
I'll grant a special pardon.

26:41.855 --> 26:45.230
Yes, thank you.

26:47.522 --> 26:49.813
It finally sunk in, didn't it?

27:15.980 --> 27:18.022
You're yummy, I bet.

27:21.022 --> 27:22.314
Huh?

27:25.064 --> 27:26.522
Papa!

27:26.522 --> 27:29.022
Papa! Papa!

27:29.022 --> 27:29.813
Me?

27:29.813 --> 27:32.855
Papa, you just named me, didn't you?

27:32.855 --> 27:34.105
Name?

27:35.522 --> 27:37.481
You said, "You're Yummie!"

27:37.481 --> 27:40.272
You named me, so you're my papa, right?

27:40.272 --> 27:42.605
"Yummie" is a great name!

27:42.605 --> 27:43.980
But what does it mean?

27:43.980 --> 27:46.855
M-Mean... um...

27:46.855 --> 27:49.189
Papa, I'm starving.

27:49.189 --> 27:50.147
Where's the food?

27:50.147 --> 27:50.938
Food?!

27:51.272 --> 27:53.105
I'm starving!

27:53.105 --> 27:54.980
Where's my food?!

27:54.980 --> 27:56.439
Oh, food, huh?

27:59.605 --> 28:01.314
Oh!

28:05.397 --> 28:06.646
Wow!

28:07.439 --> 28:09.355
You're tall, Papa.

28:09.938 --> 28:11.688
Papa, you're amazing!

28:11.688 --> 28:13.439
R-Really?

28:13.439 --> 28:16.563
Uh-huh. You're really big and cool!

28:16.563 --> 28:19.481
I wanna grow up to be like you, Papa!

28:24.481 --> 28:25.813
That was scary.

28:25.813 --> 28:27.730
You scared me!

28:28.897 --> 28:31.314
You've gotta be more careful!

28:31.314 --> 28:34.938
You're still too young
to stand up on your hind legs!

28:34.938 --> 28:36.772
Wait 'til you're bigger!

28:36.772 --> 28:37.938
I'm sorry.

28:37.938 --> 28:39.563
As long as you understand.

28:39.563 --> 28:41.980
Next time, be more care... huh?

28:46.605 --> 28:51.272
Well, he'll make a more substantial meal
if I wait 'til he gets bigger, right?

28:54.730 --> 28:56.397
This is delicious!

28:56.397 --> 28:57.980
Papa, aren't you going to eat any?

28:57.980 --> 29:00.813
Weeds are too tough for me.

29:00.813 --> 29:04.439
Go ahead, you eat my share and get bigger.

29:04.439 --> 29:07.397
Yeah,
I'm gonna eat a lot and get really big!

29:18.980 --> 29:20.189
Heart...

29:23.646 --> 29:24.855
Heart...

29:24.855 --> 29:26.230
Mom?

29:28.064 --> 29:29.439
Mom?!

29:29.439 --> 29:30.481
Heart...

29:30.481 --> 29:33.355
Where are you? Mom!

29:34.355 --> 29:39.772
Mom! Where?! Where are you?! Mom!

29:39.772 --> 29:40.813
Heart.

29:40.813 --> 29:42.481
I'm right here.

29:42.855 --> 29:45.355
You just ate me, remember?

30:17.147 --> 30:18.355
Papa...

30:34.855 --> 30:37.230
How much is he gonna eat?!

30:38.522 --> 30:42.522
Before long, he's probably
gonna have that field stripped bare.

30:43.230 --> 30:46.938
Ah, well, it doesn't make sense just
sitting around, waiting for him to get big.

30:47.897 --> 30:51.355
I'm gonna grab a bite to eat myself.

31:01.772 --> 31:03.439
Why are you following me?

31:03.855 --> 31:08.980
Um... I'm always gonna follow you, Papa!

31:08.980 --> 31:10.272
I see...

31:10.772 --> 31:15.772
But there are times, Yummie,
when a man wants to be alone.

31:15.772 --> 31:19.189
So wait for me in that field! Okay?!

31:20.980 --> 31:21.897
Got it!

31:22.230 --> 31:23.772
There's a good boy.

31:26.105 --> 31:28.855
You don't "got" anything!

31:28.855 --> 31:30.563
You wait for me right here!

31:30.563 --> 31:31.938
I'll be back soon!

31:34.272 --> 31:35.314
Yeesh!

31:35.314 --> 31:36.938
Watch it, or I'll gobble you up!

31:53.481 --> 31:57.105
I couldn't eat another bite.

31:57.688 --> 31:59.605
Is he still waiting?

31:59.605 --> 32:02.481
Well, it'd be annoying
if somebody else snatched him from me...

32:04.481 --> 32:07.897
Something's wrong with the kid
if he thinks I'm his father...

32:12.688 --> 32:15.439
I wanted to eat with you, Papa...

32:21.189 --> 32:23.563
You look yummy!

32:24.605 --> 32:27.522
Huh? You know who I am, Mister?

32:27.522 --> 32:32.064
Of course. What makes you so tasty
is that you're nice and crunchy!

32:32.064 --> 32:33.064
Crunchy?

32:33.563 --> 32:35.730
Waiiiit!!

32:41.938 --> 32:44.314
Touch somebody else's property, will ya?!

32:44.314 --> 32:45.439
Wowie!

32:45.439 --> 32:48.064
But why did you slam into him?

32:48.064 --> 32:51.980
Idiot! He was about to eat you!

32:51.980 --> 32:55.314
If you're not careful, you're gonna end up
as some meat-eater's appetizer!

32:55.314 --> 32:56.439
Huh...

32:56.439 --> 32:57.980
Thanks, Papa!

32:58.314 --> 33:00.646
You really are great.

33:00.646 --> 33:03.397
I'm gonna grow up to be big
and strong like you!

33:03.688 --> 33:06.397
Do you really understand?

33:08.355 --> 33:10.272
He doesn't understand anything!

33:10.272 --> 33:12.563
The moment I take my eyes off of him...

33:12.980 --> 33:15.397
Yummie! Where are you?!

33:39.314 --> 33:41.730
Yay! There's a bunch!

34:01.481 --> 34:03.730
Hey, hard one...

34:04.189 --> 34:07.314
What are you gonna do with those berries?

34:07.605 --> 34:09.064
I...

34:10.897 --> 34:12.522
Yummie!

34:13.397 --> 34:14.646
Yummie!

34:14.646 --> 34:15.730
Yummie!

34:15.730 --> 34:18.230
Yummie!!

34:19.688 --> 34:20.897
Yummie!

34:22.397 --> 34:25.314
Where'd you go, Yummie?!

34:25.688 --> 34:28.397
Where the devil did he go?!

34:29.355 --> 34:32.688
You two didn't eat Yummie, did you?!

34:32.688 --> 34:35.314
W-We haven't had anything to eat!

34:35.855 --> 34:39.813
Yummie, where are you?!

34:47.022 --> 34:50.522
Maybe somebody did eat him...

34:52.355 --> 34:54.147
Yummie...

34:54.147 --> 34:55.105
Papa!

34:56.855 --> 34:58.730
See, these look delicious, don't they?

34:58.730 --> 35:03.230
You don't like grass,
so I went a long way to pick 'em.

35:03.230 --> 35:04.355
Now we can eat...

35:04.355 --> 35:05.730
Idiot!!

35:06.688 --> 35:09.439
Why did you go far off by yourself?!

35:09.439 --> 35:13.688
A little kid like you wandering around
is bound to be eaten!

35:13.688 --> 35:16.439
Do you know how much I worried about you?!

35:16.439 --> 35:19.272
Next time, don't bother coming back!

35:19.272 --> 35:20.897
You can be somebody else's child!

35:26.605 --> 35:28.189
I'm sorry!

35:28.189 --> 35:31.980
I wanted to eat together, Papa!

35:31.980 --> 35:33.897
Eat? Eat what?

35:38.272 --> 35:40.147
You brought these...?

35:44.147 --> 35:47.314
A-All right.
It's all right, so stop crying.

35:47.314 --> 35:49.646
Here, I'll eat. But get up.

35:53.646 --> 35:55.439
Ready? Look.

35:59.563 --> 36:01.688
It's delicious, Yummie.

36:05.272 --> 36:06.772
Really?

36:06.772 --> 36:09.189
Really, Yummie.

36:10.314 --> 36:12.481
It really is good.

36:13.189 --> 36:14.730
Good!

36:15.272 --> 36:19.105
But I'm surprised you were able to carry
that much on your back.

36:19.105 --> 36:21.813
A nice old one helped me.

36:21.813 --> 36:22.855
Hah?!

36:23.272 --> 36:26.813
When I told him
that my name was Yummie, not "Hard-one",

36:26.813 --> 36:30.980
he said that even if I'm "Yummie"
I'm too hard to chew up for a senior citizen.

36:30.980 --> 36:33.355
I wonder what he meant...

36:33.355 --> 36:38.813
What he meant... Where is the old one?

36:45.147 --> 36:48.813
Old one, I brought my papa here!

36:50.938 --> 36:53.314
Oh, you're back, boy?

36:54.605 --> 36:56.772
What's your game?

36:56.772 --> 36:59.355
What kind of greeting is that?

36:59.355 --> 37:02.189
Don't you have any manners, young one?

37:02.481 --> 37:04.563
You ate my fruit, didn't you?

37:04.563 --> 37:07.314
Here, why don't you at least give me
your name and a word of thanks?

37:08.481 --> 37:11.563
I-I'm Heart. Thanks.

37:11.563 --> 37:14.980
Oh, you're that bad boy people talk about.

37:14.980 --> 37:19.938
A mischievous one who was raised
by a plant-eater, but now wreaks havoc.

37:19.938 --> 37:21.730
I often hear complaints
about your behavior.

37:22.481 --> 37:24.481
"Your fruit"?

37:24.481 --> 37:26.230
You're carrying it on your back...

37:26.230 --> 37:27.813
Old man, do you eat that too?

37:27.813 --> 37:31.772
I know it's disgraceful for a Big Jaw
to eat this kind of food,

37:31.772 --> 37:33.980
but I can't move like I used to.

37:33.980 --> 37:37.439
Huh? You were once a Big Jaw?

37:37.439 --> 37:38.897
How rude...

37:39.522 --> 37:45.439
Before, the young ones would give me
their leftovers, but that's stopped recently,

37:45.439 --> 37:47.064
so these are emergency rations.

37:48.355 --> 37:51.522
The same as your companion, the hard one.

37:51.522 --> 37:54.688
I told you,
my name's Yummie, not "Hard-one"!

37:54.980 --> 37:56.314
S-Stupid!

37:56.314 --> 37:58.855
I'm Bekon.

37:58.855 --> 38:04.605
Heart, if you cause too much trouble,
One-Eyed Baku will zero in on you.

38:04.605 --> 38:07.189
He's the king of this prairie.

38:07.189 --> 38:10.272
Anger him and a simple apology
won't cover it.

38:10.272 --> 38:12.272
You know about Baku?!

38:12.272 --> 38:13.980
Of course.

38:13.980 --> 38:17.147
There's nobody else like him.

38:18.772 --> 38:24.772
A long time ago, a pack of voracious
scoundrels came up from the south.

38:24.772 --> 38:28.397
And they were so huge
that nobody could defeat them.

38:28.897 --> 38:32.481
But then, Baku, alone...

38:34.439 --> 38:39.022
...defeated them,
thereby protecting our territory.

38:39.522 --> 38:43.938
After that,
Baku became the king of the prairie.

38:43.938 --> 38:47.646
He's big, strong, and prudent.

38:47.646 --> 38:50.022
You should strive to be a guy like that.

38:52.022 --> 38:53.980
Huh?! Yummie?!

38:57.230 --> 38:58.897
What are you doing?!

39:00.772 --> 39:06.439
It was different in my younger days,
but my teeth couldn't handle him now.

39:06.439 --> 39:11.147
The next time you come,
bring something softer to eat.

39:11.439 --> 39:13.355
You play the innocent, old one.

39:13.355 --> 39:15.481
By the way...

39:15.481 --> 39:17.813
What do you plan to do with him?

39:17.813 --> 39:25.481
He isn't the least bit afraid of us,
but that won't last forever.

39:26.064 --> 39:29.064
Even raised by a plant-eater,
you eat meat.

39:29.064 --> 39:32.147
So even raised by a meat-eater,
he'll eat plants.

39:32.563 --> 39:34.730
I'm sure you're fully aware of that.

39:42.855 --> 39:43.980
Come and get me!

39:58.397 --> 39:59.563
Come and get me!

40:14.439 --> 40:18.355
All right!
That's the way to carry yourself!

40:18.355 --> 40:21.439
If you can dodge me,
you'll be fine with just about anyone!

40:21.439 --> 40:22.522
Really?!

40:22.772 --> 40:24.272
Listen, Yummie.

40:24.272 --> 40:26.938
From now on,
I'm gonna train you to be a survivor.

40:26.938 --> 40:28.938
But no matter how tough it gets,
don't you cry!

40:28.938 --> 40:30.314
I'm not gonna cry!

40:30.314 --> 40:32.813
I'm gonna become strong like you, Papa!

40:33.189 --> 40:35.147
Good answer!

40:35.688 --> 40:37.064
You left yourself open!

40:41.439 --> 40:43.688
Papa, are you okay?

40:43.688 --> 40:46.481
Tomorrow, I'll teach you how to headbutt.

40:48.563 --> 40:53.355
The dust carries your smell,

40:53.355 --> 40:58.105
But I don't care, pretend I don't notice

40:58.105 --> 41:02.938
If singing passion calls forth a storm,

41:02.938 --> 41:07.105
Before long
everything should be washed away

41:07.605 --> 41:11.563
Jump kick, tail smash, give it all ya got

41:12.397 --> 41:15.855
Headbutt, heartbeat

41:16.730 --> 41:21.439
If you're faster than anyone,

41:21.439 --> 41:25.730
All you have to do
is notice that you're alone

41:26.646 --> 41:31.355
A fallen, crushed skull

41:31.355 --> 41:35.481
Will probably return to the sand someday

41:36.189 --> 41:40.688
Just like yesterday and the past, even you

41:40.688 --> 41:44.897
But right now, don't worry,
just keep running

41:45.563 --> 41:49.897
Chance, kick, tail smash, long as you live

41:50.314 --> 41:53.980
Headbutt, heartbeat

41:54.772 --> 41:59.189
Right now, all ya gotta do

41:59.189 --> 42:03.813
Is run like lightning and not look back

42:04.688 --> 42:10.105
Smear your body with the red of a lion,

42:11.855 --> 42:17.064
to the middle of scars
that can't be healed

42:18.314 --> 42:23.064
Run from the ground that's burning now

42:23.064 --> 42:30.730
And here, where you've arrived,
live forever

42:30.730 --> 42:35.646
The dust carries your smell,

42:35.646 --> 42:40.230
But I don't care, pretend I don't notice

42:40.230 --> 42:44.980
If singing passion calls forth a storm,

42:44.980 --> 42:49.314
Before long
everything should be washed away

42:49.730 --> 42:54.522
Jump kick, tail smash, give it all ya got

42:54.522 --> 42:58.230
Headbutt, heartbeat

42:58.980 --> 43:03.772
If you're faster than anyone,

43:03.772 --> 43:08.189
All you have to do is notice you're alone

43:25.730 --> 43:28.105
Listen! You need to put more oomph
into it, from the stomach!

43:41.439 --> 43:43.147
Now, that was a good one!

43:43.147 --> 43:45.813
If you roar with that voice,
most of 'em will turn tail and run!

43:45.813 --> 43:48.938
Really?! Thank you, Papa!

43:48.938 --> 43:51.522
I wanna be like you, Papa!

43:52.022 --> 43:54.563
I wonder if I can...

43:54.563 --> 43:57.646
Yeah, uh, who knows?

44:19.522 --> 44:23.022
"I wanna be like you, Papa", huh?

44:24.272 --> 44:26.105
I'm not his parent.

44:26.522 --> 44:28.646
I'm secretly raising him,

44:29.522 --> 44:31.772
but someday, the lie will come to light.

44:53.813 --> 44:57.147
How did Mom feel, raising me?

45:20.314 --> 45:22.147
Hey, Yummie...

45:22.439 --> 45:23.980
What, Papa?

45:25.938 --> 45:29.730
I've taught you everything I know.

45:29.730 --> 45:30.522
Huh?

45:31.022 --> 45:32.646
Today, we go our separate ways.

45:33.064 --> 45:35.439
From now on, you live on your own.

45:36.938 --> 45:41.022
Don't forget what I taught you
and be careful, so you can live long.

45:51.355 --> 45:53.897
Do you understand what I'm saying?

45:59.688 --> 46:01.064
Nooo!!

46:01.064 --> 46:03.646
We can't be together forever!

46:03.646 --> 46:04.481
Why not?

46:04.481 --> 46:07.605
No! No! I won't go!

46:08.272 --> 46:10.688
Papa, I wanna be like you!

46:10.688 --> 46:13.022
I'm gonna stay with you!

46:13.522 --> 46:17.646
You mustn't be like me... Yummie.

46:18.980 --> 46:21.646
You can't be like me.

46:22.605 --> 46:24.481
Why do you say that?

46:24.481 --> 46:26.105
I don't care! I don't care!

46:26.105 --> 46:28.646
Papa, I'm gonna stay with you!

46:29.355 --> 46:33.355
All right, let's have a race.

46:33.355 --> 46:36.646
If you beat me,
I'll stay with you forever.

46:36.646 --> 46:37.230
Eh?

46:38.022 --> 46:39.147
Papa?

46:39.439 --> 46:41.314
You'd better get along.

46:41.314 --> 46:44.605
If you don't have a head start on me,
you stand no chance of winning.

46:44.605 --> 46:46.022
Huh? But...

46:46.022 --> 46:47.397
Go on now.

46:47.397 --> 46:48.646
Papa...

46:49.855 --> 46:51.688
Hurry up, Yummie.

46:51.688 --> 46:56.397
Papa, if I win,
will you really stay with me forever?

46:56.397 --> 46:58.855
Ready... go!

47:57.897 --> 48:00.605
Papa, Papa, Papa!!

48:01.897 --> 48:04.855
Go, Yummie, go!

48:12.730 --> 48:14.272
Yummie...

48:17.314 --> 48:18.563
Take care of yourself.

48:51.272 --> 48:53.022
Papa...?

48:54.147 --> 48:55.522
Papa?

48:56.938 --> 48:58.481
Where did you come from?

49:03.314 --> 49:04.147
Huh?

49:17.147 --> 49:19.147
What's wrong, runt?

49:19.147 --> 49:21.189
Are you done already?

49:25.897 --> 49:26.646
You little...!

49:26.646 --> 49:29.397
Owowowow!

49:29.397 --> 49:31.439
Hey, don't go overboard.

49:31.439 --> 49:33.147
You'll break your leg.

49:33.147 --> 49:35.938
You think a pipsqueak like this
is tough enough to break my leg?!

49:36.688 --> 49:39.646
Little booger is small, but...

49:40.522 --> 49:41.105
Take that!

49:49.980 --> 49:53.022
Oh, he still has some fight left in him.

50:02.272 --> 50:03.355
Yummie!

50:09.522 --> 50:13.147
Hey, small fry, are you alive?

50:15.064 --> 50:16.646
Maybe he's dead.

50:16.646 --> 50:18.605
Yummie!!

50:19.855 --> 50:21.688
Oh, you.

50:22.147 --> 50:24.522
Take a hike, Heart.

50:24.522 --> 50:25.813
You're not wanted here.

50:35.355 --> 50:37.980
Sleepy baby, sleepy baby,
sleepy, go to sleep

50:37.980 --> 50:40.357
You dare snatch prey
right out of his mouth?!

50:40.357 --> 50:43.189
Sleepy baby, sleepy baby,
sleepy, go to sleep

50:43.189 --> 50:46.938
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry

50:46.938 --> 50:51.397
With his coarse body and sharp fangs

50:51.397 --> 50:55.230
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry

50:55.230 --> 50:59.314
He says, "Where are the crying children?
I'm coming to get you!"

51:00.064 --> 51:02.189
"With my coarse body..."

51:02.980 --> 51:04.189
-What's he angry about?

51:04.189 --> 51:05.436
And my sharp fangs..."
- What's he angry about?

51:05.436 --> 51:06.397
And my sharp fangs..."
- You're the one who stole from us!

51:06.397 --> 51:07.772
-You're the one who stole from us!

51:08.272 --> 51:12.897
He says, "Where are the crying children?
I'm coming to get you!"

51:23.355 --> 51:27.161
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry

51:27.161 --> 51:31.329
With his coarse body and sharp fangs

51:31.605 --> 51:32.565
-Scum!
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry

51:32.565 --> 51:35.272
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry

51:35.272 --> 51:39.522
He says, "Where are the crying children?
I'm coming to get you!"

51:39.980 --> 51:42.314
"With my coarse body..."

51:44.147 --> 51:46.232
"And my sharp fangs..."

51:46.232 --> 51:48.314
H-Heart, you...

51:48.314 --> 51:52.522
He says, "Where are the crying children?
I'm coming to get you!"

52:33.439 --> 52:35.897
This is your work, isn't it?

52:36.522 --> 52:39.105
You beat all of them by yourself?

52:42.688 --> 52:44.397
There are no bite wounds.

52:45.022 --> 52:47.272
Why didn't you use your fangs?

52:51.897 --> 52:53.272
Baku...

52:55.147 --> 52:58.938
You encroached on others' territory
and harmed members of your own species.

52:59.980 --> 53:01.147
Get far away from here.

53:01.563 --> 53:05.397
And never set foot in this prairie again.

53:06.646 --> 53:10.355
If you come back,
your next opponent will be me.

53:20.897 --> 53:22.688
Damn you, Heart...

53:48.772 --> 53:51.189
Yummie... Yummie...

53:55.481 --> 53:57.189
Papa...?

53:57.688 --> 54:01.938
Yummie... They did a real number on you.

54:02.481 --> 54:07.230
Papa... I didn't lose the race, did I?

54:07.230 --> 54:08.064
Eh?

54:08.938 --> 54:11.855
From now on,
we can be together forever, right?

54:13.230 --> 54:15.105
Right, Papa?

54:21.897 --> 54:23.481
Let's go together, Yummie.

54:23.481 --> 54:26.189
Father and son, together.

54:26.813 --> 54:28.355
I'm so glad...

54:48.147 --> 54:52.105
It's warm in your tummy, Papa.

54:52.105 --> 54:55.272
Dummy. I didn't eat you!

54:55.272 --> 54:56.605
You're in my mouth.

55:07.563 --> 55:11.772
Exile was quite a lenient sentence,
wasn't it?

55:12.314 --> 55:15.605
Some won't be satisfied with the judgment.

55:15.605 --> 55:18.272
I bet there'll be more trouble
down the line.

55:18.897 --> 55:20.813
No, it won't happen again.

55:21.730 --> 55:23.022
Hmm...

55:24.355 --> 55:30.646
By the way, that Heart is the spitting
image of you when you were young.

55:30.980 --> 55:34.355
The scarlet skin texture,
the solid-colored forehead...

55:34.855 --> 55:36.772
Rare characteristics...

55:41.314 --> 55:43.980
That egg you lost...

55:44.272 --> 55:46.938
The child you were meant to have
with poor Kamie...

55:46.938 --> 55:47.688
Was that...

55:47.688 --> 55:49.105
Something that happened a long time ago.

55:54.522 --> 55:57.938
Well, I accept this gratefully.

55:57.938 --> 56:00.272
Pick me some of those red berries, too.

56:00.272 --> 56:02.855
As a garnish,
they go surprisingly well with meat.

57:19.439 --> 57:22.980
Hey, Pero Pero!

57:26.897 --> 57:28.397
Hi, Heart.

57:28.397 --> 57:30.105
So, you've decided to go home?

57:30.105 --> 57:35.563
Yeah. I'm intrigued
by what that migratory bird told you.

57:36.064 --> 57:38.980
About how
Egg Mountain will be destroyed...

57:56.314 --> 57:59.563
Do you remember the first time we met?

58:00.064 --> 58:02.105
That again?

58:02.105 --> 58:03.646
How many times
do you have to bring that up?

58:04.105 --> 58:08.938
Sorry,
but I can't forget your big frame falling,

58:08.938 --> 58:11.688
crying out, "Somebody, help!",

58:14.105 --> 58:16.522
and then sinking my way.

58:16.522 --> 58:18.688
Not like I could help it.

58:18.688 --> 58:21.105
That cliff collapsed
right out from under me.

58:36.730 --> 58:40.772
At first, you hid your identity...

58:41.481 --> 58:44.897
The fact that you were a fearsome Big Jaw
of the shore.

58:46.938 --> 58:48.397
Sorry about that.

58:59.314 --> 59:03.897
But when you saved me
from a Big Jaw of the sea...

59:04.522 --> 59:06.355
...my cover was blown, huh?

59:27.646 --> 59:32.314
Even so, I wasn't scared of you.

59:33.064 --> 59:35.646
Well, you saved my life, Pero Pero.

59:35.646 --> 59:37.355
I'd never eat you.

59:37.355 --> 59:39.646
Then what about that boy?

59:40.105 --> 59:42.481
He thinks I'm his father, so...

59:44.439 --> 59:48.147
That's what I like about you.

01:00:10.938 --> 01:00:14.980
When I was a kid, I ran out on my mother
without saying anything.

01:00:15.688 --> 01:00:17.855
Because you were afraid you'd eat her?

01:00:18.439 --> 01:00:23.772
That's right. But now I'm afraid of her
seeing me like this, as I am.

01:00:24.397 --> 01:00:27.272
Well, I think she'd be fine.

01:00:27.272 --> 01:00:29.230
You're a good guy.

01:00:29.230 --> 01:00:29.980
So...

01:00:32.938 --> 01:00:36.897
My advice is go to see your mother
at once,

01:00:37.314 --> 01:00:40.022
before Egg Mountain is destroyed.

01:00:40.314 --> 01:00:42.314
Run swiftly, Heart!

01:00:47.980 --> 01:00:51.314
Bye-bye! Let's meet again!

01:00:53.563 --> 01:00:54.688
See you again.

01:01:00.147 --> 01:01:01.855
Yummie, wake up.

01:01:01.855 --> 01:01:02.938
We're leaving.

01:01:15.397 --> 01:01:16.314
Oh!

01:01:28.980 --> 01:01:31.105
That's happened many times this year...

01:01:32.772 --> 01:01:35.897
Mom, on a day like this...

01:01:41.272 --> 01:01:44.522
The smoke stinks,
thanks to the way the wind's blowin'...

01:01:50.897 --> 01:01:53.605
It's been a long time
since something like this happened.

01:01:54.189 --> 01:01:56.980
Egg Mountain just may erupt.

01:01:57.855 --> 01:01:59.314
Baku!

01:02:00.772 --> 01:02:03.230
It's him! The lawbreaker came back!

01:02:03.813 --> 01:02:08.355
Gonza went alone to drive him away,
but the way that guy is now, I'm doubtful...

01:02:08.355 --> 01:02:10.147
By "the lawbreaker",
you mean that one guy?

01:02:10.147 --> 01:02:11.230
I mean Heart!

01:02:11.522 --> 01:02:13.688
Heart, who was exiled from here!

01:02:16.605 --> 01:02:18.730
He was running towards Egg Mountain.

01:02:18.730 --> 01:02:20.730
Gonza chased after him.

01:02:20.730 --> 01:02:23.230
Bekon,
could you keep an eye on things here?

01:02:23.688 --> 01:02:25.646
Sure, but what are you...?

01:02:26.605 --> 01:02:27.772
Oh...

01:02:32.147 --> 01:02:35.147
Ah, well, at a time like this...

01:02:35.147 --> 01:02:37.563
...all I can do is sit back
and let things run their course.

01:02:38.147 --> 01:02:39.605
Oh!

01:02:44.105 --> 01:02:46.855
You're not getting past me... Heart.

01:02:48.439 --> 01:02:52.272
Huh. Is that the kid
from our last encounter?

01:02:52.897 --> 01:02:54.980
What do you want with my Papa?!

01:02:54.980 --> 01:02:57.563
Oh, you're here with your "Papa"!

01:02:57.980 --> 01:02:59.105
Step aside!

01:02:59.105 --> 01:03:01.105
I'm not moving.

01:03:01.105 --> 01:03:04.105
I came here to settle things
between us once and for all.

01:03:04.563 --> 01:03:05.980
Come on, Heart.

01:03:05.980 --> 01:03:09.064
If you want to get by,
you'll have to defeat me first.

01:03:09.813 --> 01:03:11.105
You'll die...

01:03:11.605 --> 01:03:13.563
And I'll take you with me.

01:03:23.272 --> 01:03:24.855
Come on, Yummie.

01:03:24.855 --> 01:03:25.563
Okay!

01:03:33.605 --> 01:03:38.314
Pipsqueak, he's not your father!

01:03:39.439 --> 01:03:40.563
I know!

01:03:40.938 --> 01:03:42.688
I'm not a child anymore!

01:03:45.522 --> 01:03:47.980
But Papa is Papa!

01:03:53.064 --> 01:03:55.563
Had to spoil my fun...

01:03:57.355 --> 01:03:59.064
Yummie...

01:04:17.147 --> 01:04:20.397
This is getting serious...

01:04:27.022 --> 01:04:28.355
Mom!

01:04:29.688 --> 01:04:32.646
Damn it! Should we work our way around
from the plains?

01:04:32.646 --> 01:04:35.646
She may have rejoined the herd...

01:04:40.938 --> 01:04:41.813
Ow, it's hot!

01:04:41.813 --> 01:04:42.688
Yummie!

01:04:44.522 --> 01:04:46.980
Y'know, you've gotten bigger!

01:05:28.688 --> 01:05:29.522
The herd!

01:05:29.522 --> 01:05:31.730
Mom! Light!

01:05:33.105 --> 01:05:34.730
Are you here?! Mom!

01:05:34.730 --> 01:05:36.439
Mom!

01:05:39.064 --> 01:05:42.272
Mom! Light! Are you here?!

01:05:43.272 --> 01:05:45.481
Heart?! Heart, is that you?

01:05:46.355 --> 01:05:47.147
Light?!

01:05:47.646 --> 01:05:50.189
Light,
you've got to get away from here now!

01:05:50.189 --> 01:05:51.688
If you don't get away from the mountain...

01:05:51.688 --> 01:05:52.646
Mom...

01:05:53.688 --> 01:05:55.147
Where's Mom?!

01:05:58.022 --> 01:06:00.772
She left this morning
and hasn't come back.

01:06:01.397 --> 01:06:04.688
I think maybe
she went to where we used to live.

01:06:04.688 --> 01:06:06.938
Why aren't you out there looking for her?!

01:06:06.938 --> 01:06:09.980
You have no right to say that,
not after being gone for years!

01:06:09.980 --> 01:06:13.439
Right now, I have to put the herd
above thinking about myself!

01:06:15.522 --> 01:06:18.189
Light, don't talk to him!

01:06:19.522 --> 01:06:21.272
All you have to do is escape!

01:06:21.272 --> 01:06:23.646
If you leave now, you can get downstream!

01:06:24.522 --> 01:06:26.897
The children born this year
are still small...

01:06:26.897 --> 01:06:28.980
...and everyone is so scared,
they can barely move.

01:06:29.605 --> 01:06:31.022
I don't know what to do!

01:06:35.189 --> 01:06:37.605
But I can't leave here now.

01:06:38.397 --> 01:06:40.772
I have to protect the herd.

01:06:40.772 --> 01:06:45.646
That's more important than Mom?!

01:06:49.688 --> 01:06:50.980
Ridiculous!

01:06:52.481 --> 01:06:53.522
Get outta here!

01:06:53.522 --> 01:06:54.938
I'm gonna eat you!

01:06:54.938 --> 01:06:56.230
Run!

01:06:56.230 --> 01:06:58.147
If you don't get outta here,
I'm gonna devour you!

01:07:02.439 --> 01:07:03.688
We'll be eaten!

01:07:05.022 --> 01:07:07.772
Calm down! Everyone, calm down!

01:07:11.855 --> 01:07:13.105
Heart...

01:07:20.272 --> 01:07:23.064
Egg Mountain's egg is... gone?!

01:07:28.439 --> 01:07:30.230
Mom!!

01:07:35.522 --> 01:07:37.439
Egg Mountain is gone!

01:07:37.439 --> 01:07:39.730
Mom! Are you safe?!

01:07:48.397 --> 01:07:50.230
Mom!!

01:07:52.980 --> 01:07:56.355
I forgot the forest was this thick!

01:08:02.355 --> 01:08:06.064
Mom!!

01:08:21.897 --> 01:08:22.772
Mom!

01:08:30.272 --> 01:08:33.522
Heart! Heart, it's you, isn't it?

01:08:39.646 --> 01:08:44.897
I was so worried
when you ran off without a word.

01:08:46.314 --> 01:08:48.229
Mom!!

01:08:51.897 --> 01:08:54.979
Mom, I'm so happy you're safe!

01:08:55.522 --> 01:08:58.897
Heart... I've missed you.

01:08:59.854 --> 01:09:04.897
But... look what I've become!

01:09:04.897 --> 01:09:07.522
No, I knew as soon as I saw you...

01:09:07.854 --> 01:09:10.481
...that you were my kind Heart.

01:09:10.854 --> 01:09:12.064
Mom!

01:09:21.354 --> 01:09:23.813
Mom, we can't stay here.

01:09:23.813 --> 01:09:25.522
We have to get away from the mountain.

01:09:25.522 --> 01:09:29.979
Yes. When you came, the children were resting
after coming down from the ridge.

01:09:30.354 --> 01:09:31.522
Children?

01:09:31.522 --> 01:09:33.688
Come out, everyone.

01:09:33.688 --> 01:09:34.979
It's time to leave.

01:09:45.522 --> 01:09:46.979
Whose children are these?

01:09:49.522 --> 01:09:51.688
Don't be afraid, everyone.

01:09:51.979 --> 01:09:54.104
This is your big brother.

01:09:54.104 --> 01:09:55.439
Big brother?!

01:09:56.022 --> 01:09:58.064
Then they're your...?

01:09:58.522 --> 01:09:59.481
Mm-hm.

01:10:02.688 --> 01:10:05.397
I see. Your children...

01:10:05.688 --> 01:10:06.646
Papa!

01:10:06.646 --> 01:10:07.314
Oh...

01:10:07.604 --> 01:10:09.604
Heart, who's this boy?

01:10:09.897 --> 01:10:13.439
Um... This is Yummie.

01:10:13.439 --> 01:10:17.439
He's, uh... my son.

01:10:20.481 --> 01:10:22.354
Parents and children resemble each other,
don't they?

01:10:22.938 --> 01:10:25.229
It's a pleasure to meet you, Yummie.

01:10:28.104 --> 01:10:29.938
I'm your grandma.

01:10:30.688 --> 01:10:32.854
Is Heart a kind father?

01:10:32.854 --> 01:10:35.897
Yeah. And Papa is also really strong!

01:10:35.897 --> 01:10:37.104
Oh my!

01:10:47.022 --> 01:10:49.022
Well, shall we go?

01:11:03.189 --> 01:11:04.104
Heart!

01:11:04.397 --> 01:11:06.104
It's okay, Mom!

01:11:26.229 --> 01:11:28.439
Mom, are you all right?

01:11:30.104 --> 01:11:31.604
Yes, thank you, Light!

01:11:31.897 --> 01:11:36.604
Light... You don't have to watch the herd?

01:11:37.272 --> 01:11:41.104
They've all escaped,
thanks to you menacing them, I think.

01:11:41.854 --> 01:11:44.272
Well, good. Ow...

01:11:45.897 --> 01:11:47.604
We'd better hurry.

01:11:57.397 --> 01:11:59.064
Hey, Heart...

01:11:59.064 --> 01:12:00.104
What?

01:12:02.272 --> 01:12:04.604
Don't you eat meat?

01:12:08.229 --> 01:12:11.064
I do. Without eating meat, I'd die.

01:12:12.314 --> 01:12:16.104
I just decide what and whether or not to eat,
based on the circumstances.

01:12:20.147 --> 01:12:21.104
Oh...

01:12:24.104 --> 01:12:26.314
Big brother, are you going to eat me?

01:12:26.314 --> 01:12:29.104
No, I wouldn't do that.

01:12:29.104 --> 01:12:32.439
But you have to be careful
about guys like me.

01:12:32.854 --> 01:12:33.979
In other words...

01:12:35.522 --> 01:12:41.772
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry

01:12:41.772 --> 01:12:47.397
With his coarse body and sharp fangs

01:12:47.397 --> 01:12:53.104
The Big Jaw comes for children who cry

01:12:53.104 --> 01:12:55.729
-He says, "Where are the crying children?"

01:12:55.729 --> 01:12:56.508
- Baku hasn't come back yet...
- He says, "Where are the crying children?

01:12:56.508 --> 01:12:58.729
- Baku hasn't come back yet...
- I'm coming to get you!"

01:12:59.229 --> 01:13:02.164
"With my coarse body...

01:13:02.164 --> 01:13:04.979
With my coarse body..."

01:13:04.979 --> 01:13:08.107
"And my sharp fangs...

01:13:08.107 --> 01:13:11.314
And my sharp fangs..."

01:13:11.314 --> 01:13:17.772
He says, "Where are the crying children?
I'm coming to get you."

01:13:24.354 --> 01:13:26.563
Let's hurry
so we can catch up with everyone.

01:13:32.064 --> 01:13:33.522
Baku?!

01:13:34.938 --> 01:13:37.854
I followed the smell of Gonza's blood.

01:13:40.272 --> 01:13:43.772
At this point, there's nothing
that needs to be said, is there?

01:13:44.938 --> 01:13:47.604
Everyone, go on ahead.

01:13:47.604 --> 01:13:48.604
Heart?

01:13:48.604 --> 01:13:50.938
He's got business with me.

01:13:50.938 --> 01:13:52.147
What is it, Heart?

01:13:52.897 --> 01:13:56.147
Light, take Yummie, too.

01:13:56.147 --> 01:13:57.314
Papa!

01:13:57.314 --> 01:14:00.064
Heart, no...

01:14:00.064 --> 01:14:01.104
Let's go together!

01:14:01.104 --> 01:14:02.104
Heart!

01:14:17.481 --> 01:14:19.022
Don't run!

01:14:19.022 --> 01:14:20.938
If anyone runs away, I'll eat all of them!

01:14:21.897 --> 01:14:23.229
I'm not gonna run away!

01:16:21.397 --> 01:16:23.272
It's true. You are...

01:16:48.354 --> 01:16:49.646
Everyone!

01:17:29.147 --> 01:17:30.522
What's wrong?

01:17:30.522 --> 01:17:32.646
This isn't settled yet.

01:17:34.272 --> 01:17:38.563
If you want a hope of saving them,
you had better hurry up and finish this showdown.

01:17:38.563 --> 01:17:40.646
This place is about to be
engulfed in flames.

01:17:58.772 --> 01:17:59.979
Not like that!

01:18:08.688 --> 01:18:12.772
Show me your strength, head-on!

01:18:12.772 --> 01:18:14.272
Fine!

01:18:48.522 --> 01:18:49.897
Is that all you got?!

01:19:10.022 --> 01:19:11.104
Heart!

01:19:11.688 --> 01:19:14.314
Baku!!

01:19:50.563 --> 01:19:51.688
Heart...

01:20:06.854 --> 01:20:08.022
Heart!

01:20:08.688 --> 01:20:09.897
Mom!

01:20:34.481 --> 01:20:37.189
Please, let him go!

01:20:41.147 --> 01:20:42.439
Please!

01:20:42.439 --> 01:20:44.064
Don't kill him!

01:20:49.064 --> 01:20:50.104
Who are you?

01:20:51.604 --> 01:20:52.189
P-P-P...

01:20:52.189 --> 01:20:53.688
He's my child.

01:20:53.688 --> 01:20:55.563
So please...

01:20:56.229 --> 01:20:57.688
Let him go!

01:21:02.729 --> 01:21:05.147
You raised him?

01:21:06.189 --> 01:21:06.938
Yes.

01:21:11.397 --> 01:21:17.147
The first time I met him,
he was skinny, all skin and bones.

01:21:20.022 --> 01:21:22.481
Big Jaws are the kings of the meat-eaters.

01:21:22.481 --> 01:21:24.772
If we don't eat meat, we can't survive.

01:21:25.354 --> 01:21:27.397
What were you trying to do with him?

01:21:29.522 --> 01:21:32.064
Even if in the end, I was eaten...

01:21:32.439 --> 01:21:36.522
Idiot! Did you intend to sentence him
to a lifetime of suffering?!

01:21:48.229 --> 01:21:53.439
Although, if you hadn't raised him,
he wouldn't have lived.

01:21:58.229 --> 01:21:59.481
Take him.

01:21:59.979 --> 01:22:01.772
This bout is a draw.

01:22:03.897 --> 01:22:07.272
You've gotten stronger, Heart.

01:22:08.854 --> 01:22:11.854
Are you Heart's...?

01:22:15.646 --> 01:22:17.272
The next time we meet...

01:22:18.314 --> 01:22:23.064
No, tell him it's better
that we don't meet again.

01:23:02.729 --> 01:23:03.854
Stop it!

01:23:11.646 --> 01:23:13.772
It's early,
before the changing of the seasons...

01:23:14.104 --> 01:23:16.729
...but we're going to head north.

01:23:17.064 --> 01:23:19.772
And we may not return.

01:23:20.314 --> 01:23:21.729
I'm going to stay behind.

01:23:21.729 --> 01:23:22.854
Mom!

01:23:22.854 --> 01:23:27.272
Let's live together,
you, me, and your little brothers.

01:23:31.563 --> 01:23:35.979
It's better for my little brothers
to live among their own kind.

01:23:40.064 --> 01:23:41.272
You're probably right.

01:23:42.439 --> 01:23:44.439
You wanted the same thing, didn't you?

01:23:44.813 --> 01:23:49.854
No. Mom, we can't live together now...

01:23:50.147 --> 01:23:52.979
...but thank you for raising me.

01:23:55.439 --> 01:23:57.354
I'm glad that I'm your son.

01:24:02.064 --> 01:24:03.354
Heart!

01:24:11.064 --> 01:24:18.772
No matter where you go,
I'll always, always, always...

01:24:31.189 --> 01:24:33.022
Well, I'm going to get going.

01:24:33.022 --> 01:24:36.229
Light, take good care of Mom
and our little brothers.

01:24:36.229 --> 01:24:36.729
I will.

01:24:36.729 --> 01:24:38.272
You take good care, too.

01:24:38.272 --> 01:24:40.688
Yeah. And you, too, Light.

01:24:49.604 --> 01:24:51.522
Let's go, Yummie!

01:24:51.522 --> 01:24:52.314
Okay!

01:25:06.439 --> 01:25:09.897
Heart!!

01:25:11.147 --> 01:25:14.147
Mom!!

01:26:10.897 --> 01:26:23.064
Is the scenery in your heart the same
setting sun that's in mine?

01:26:23.064 --> 01:26:35.354
When I miss you, I think of you with a smile
appearing on your tear-stained face

01:26:36.064 --> 01:26:44.189
Somehow, if only a for a moment

01:26:44.189 --> 01:26:52.439
feel the precious thing
that can only be seen in your heart

01:26:52.439 --> 01:27:04.688
Right now, over and over, the words
we want to say to each other have no answer

01:27:04.688 --> 01:27:11.314
If I just live strongly, second by second,

01:27:11.314 --> 01:27:24.854
the memories inscribed in my heart
will never disappear

01:27:24.854 --> 01:27:25.979
I am here, you, my beloved,

01:27:25.979 --> 01:27:28.272
-So you finally came back?
I am here, you, my beloved,

01:27:28.272 --> 01:27:30.981
-You look much the worse for wear.
I am here, you, my beloved,

01:27:30.981 --> 01:27:31.563
are here, and our song is here

01:27:31.563 --> 01:27:33.814
-Ah, well, have a seat.
are here, and our song is here

01:27:33.814 --> 01:27:34.522
are here, and our song is here

01:27:34.522 --> 01:27:36.211
-If you're hungry,
are here, and our song is here

01:27:36.211 --> 01:27:36.979
-go ahead and have some of my berries.
are here, and our song is here

01:27:36.979 --> 01:27:39.005
-go ahead and have some of my berries.
How many more times will we

01:27:39.005 --> 01:27:40.325
How many more times will we

01:27:40.325 --> 01:27:41.688
be able to see this setting sun together?

01:27:41.688 --> 01:27:44.981
-That's not what a respectable Big Jaw eats.
be able to see this setting sun together?

01:27:44.981 --> 01:27:48.362
be able to see this setting sun together?

01:27:59.272 --> 01:28:06.688
The wish that I'm singing now
is for our tears and smiles

01:28:06.688 --> 01:28:11.272
to always be pictured in the sky

01:28:11.272 --> 01:28:18.354
If I just live strongly, second by second,

01:28:18.354 --> 01:28:24.729
the setting sun will reflect in these eyes

01:28:24.979 --> 01:28:25.354
Right now, over and over,

01:28:25.354 --> 01:28:27.606
-Egg mountain?!
Right now, over and over,

01:28:27.606 --> 01:28:28.255
Right now, over and over,

01:28:28.255 --> 01:28:37.354
the words we want to say
to each other have no answer

01:28:37.354 --> 01:28:44.064
If I just live strongly, second by second,

01:28:44.064 --> 01:28:49.772
I'm sure I'll be able to hear in my heart,

01:28:49.772 --> 01:29:01.229
"There are no dreams
that can't come true."

01:29:09.229 --> 01:29:13.022
No matter where you go, I'll always...

01:29:13.813 --> 01:29:16.022
Always, always...

01:29:16.522 --> 01:29:18.563
I'll always love you.
